sn\\'t load properly, try refreshing or using the search function again\\\\n- Direct messages appear in the left sidebar under \\\\\"Direct Messages\\\\\" section\\\\n- The message input field should be available once the chat interface loads\\\\n- Users may respond asynchronously, so check back periodically for responses\\\\n\\\\n## Common Issues:\\\\n- The interface may get stuck on the home page\\\\n- The chat interface may not load immediately after clicking on a user\\\\n- Using the search function is the most reliable way to find and message users\\\\n- Some users may not respond immediately, requiring patience\\\\n\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='get_operation_details', arguments={'platform': 'RocketChat', 'operation': 'ContactUserForRequirements'}), MCPAction(name='get_operation_details', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud', 'operation': 'CreateJobDescriptionAndShareLink'}, thought='', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"# OwnCloud - Create Job Description and Share Link\\\\n\\\\n## Steps:\\\\n1. Navigate to OwnCloud at http://the-agent-company.com:8092\\\\n2. Create a job description by merging template.md and requirement.txt files\\\\n3. Upload the job_description.md file to the Documents directory using curl:\\\\n   - `curl -u \\\\\"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\\\\\" -T \\\\\"/workspace/job_description.md\\\\\" \\\\\"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/job_description.md\\\\\"`\\\\n4. Create a share link using the API:\\\\n   - `curl -u \\\\\"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\\\\\" -X POST \\\\\"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/ocs/v2.php/apps/files_sharing/api/v1/shares\\\\\" -d \\\\\"path=/Documents/job_description.md\\\\\" -d \\\\\"shareType=3\\\\\" -d \\\\\"permissions=1\\\\\"`\\\\n5. Extract the share URL from the API response (look for the <url> tag in the XML response)\\\\n6. Save the share URL to link.txt file in the workspace\\\\n\\\\n## Verification Steps:\\\\n- Verify file upload by downloading via share link: `curl -s \\\\\"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/s/{token}/download\\\\\" | head -20`\\\\n- Confirm link.txt contains the correct share URL\\\\n\\\\n## Notes:\\\\n- The file may not immediately appear in the browser interface but can be verified via download\\\\n- Share type 3 creates a public link accessible to anyone\\\\n- Permissions=1 provides read-only access\\\\n- The share URL format is: http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/s/{token}\\\\n- The direct download URL is: http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/s/{token}/download\\\\n- The API returns XML format, extract the URL from the <url> tag\\\\n- Always verify both upload and share link creation were successful\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='get_operation_details', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud', 'operation': 'CreateJobDescriptionAndShareLink'}), BrowseInteractiveAction(browser_actions=\"\\ngoto('http://the-agent-company.com:3000')\\nnoop(2000)\\n\", thought='Perfect! Now I have the SOPs for both platforms. Let me start by contacting Zhang Wei on RocketChat to ask about key job responsibilities.', browsergym_send_msg_to_user='', action=<ActionType.BROWSE_INTERACTIVE: 'browse_interactive'>, security_risk=None), BrowserOutputObservation(content='<::before><::after> _\\ue043_ <::before><::after> _\\ue055_ <::before><::after> _\\ue0ff_ <::before><::after> _\\ue074_ <::before><::after> _\\ue027_ <::before><::after> _\\ue057_\\n\\n* * *\\n\\n__ More unreads \\n\\nOmnichannel \\n\\n<::before><::after> _\\ue0b7_ <::before><::after> _\\ue103_\\n\\n* * *\\n\\nChannels \\n\\n[ _\\ue040_ general  <::before><::after> _\\ue087_ ](/channel/general)\\n\\n[ _\\ue040_ kudos  <::before><::after> _\\ue087_ ](/channel/kudos)\\n\\nDirect Messages \\n\\n[ mike_chen  <::b